   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Libya - FNs blixtappell 2011 UNICEF</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Libya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till FNs blixtappell 2011 f&#xf6;r UNICEF.  Totalt beslut 20 MSEK, varav UNICEF 5 MSEK, UNHCR 12 MSEK och Islamic Relief 3 MSEK. V&#xe4;ntas bidra till att kvinnors och barn r&#xe4;ttigheter tillgodoses. Regionalt f&#xf6;r de tredjelandsmedborgare och flyktingar fr&#xe5;n Libyen, inklusive f&#xf6;r Libyen n&#xe4;r arbete i landet &#xe4;r m&#xf6;jligt.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to UN Flash Appeal 2011 for UNICEF.  Total decision 20 MSEK, of which UNICEF 5 MSEK, UNHCR 12 MSEK and Islamic Relief 3 MSEK. Expected to contribute to that women and children human rights are met. Regional for TCN and refugees from Libya, including for Libya when access is possible.</narrative>
  </description>
